        "fields": {
          "notes": "The exact cover names ИЗДАНІЕ «ЖИЗНЬ ДЛЯ ВСѢХЪ»; the title page separately verifies С. ПЕТЕРБУРГЪ and 1913 without naming a publisher; page 8 separately names the brothers-Linnik printer. Publishing and manufacture are therefore modeled as distinct provision activities. Wikisource calls this a fourth edition, while the visible translator preface lists four prior edition years ending in 1911; the edition sequence remains unresolved pending reconciliation of that history."
